comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-01T12:13:22.473Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: exact all-status searches found storage and Sentry precedents but no item owning PM-CLI-2S or this copy-resource classification. Live evidence is summarized without raw paths, entity identifiers, hostnames, or event payloads."
  "2026-08-07T19:54:22.750Z","harness:codex","Live structured gate refresh 2026-08-07: PM-CLI-2S remains one of two high groups in the 14-day release window after the gate moved from prose patterns to SDK error-code and exit-code classification. Telemetry is healthy at 0.91% finish errors with zero failures missing codes. This item remains open and unclaimed; no raw path, event payload, host identity, or private topology was retained."
  "2026-08-08T07:58:25.041Z","harness:claude-code","ENOSPC escaped as a raw Node error from the fs.cp calls in the snapshot restore stage, so it was captured as an unactionable production exception naming only a scrubbed copyfile frame. Added withSnapshotFilesystemGuard, a bounded boundary around the create_object and restore_stage filesystem stages that converts host environment faults (ENOSPC/EDQUOT -> workspace_snapshot_storage_exhausted, EACCES/EPERM/EROFS -> workspace_snapshot_permission_denied) into declared PmCliError refusals with recovery guidance. Because shouldCaptureCliError already excludes PmCliError, these host conditions no longer create high Sentry issues at all, which is the correct disposition: a full disk on an operator machine is not a pm defect and must not gate pm releases. The operation label is a fixed identifier and never a path; a test asserts the workspace topology appears in neither the message nor the context. Non-errno failures still propagate untouched so real defects are still reported."
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  src/sdk/workspace-snapshot.ts,project,Typed environment-fault boundary for snapshot copy and write stages
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/workspace-snapshot.spec.ts,project,300
close_reason: Typed environment-fault boundary added around snapshot filesystem stages with path-free actionable guidance; Sentry PM-CLI-2S resolved in next release and the reliability gate now passes.
